      "preview": "גְּוִיָּה: substantivo feminino: corpo, cadáver.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino. corpo, cadáver</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:3\" href=\"/Nahum.3.3\">Na 3.3</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:8\" href=\"/Judges.14.8\">Jz 14.8</a> + 2 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיָּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.10\">1Sm 31.10</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:6\" href=\"/Daniel.10.6\">Dn 10.6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיָּתֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:18\" href=\"/Genesis.47.18\">Gn 47.18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיָּתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:3\" href=\"/Nahum.3.3\">Na 3.3</a>; plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 110:6\" href=\"/Psalms.110.6\">Sl 110.6</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיֹּתֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.37\">Ne 9.37</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיֹּתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.23\">Ez 1.23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיֹּתֵיהֶ֑נָה</span> versículo <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.11\">Ez 1.11</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>corpo</em> humano vivo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:18\" href=\"/Genesis.47.18\">Gn 47.18</a> (singular, de muitas pessoas) cf. plural <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.37\">Ne 9.37</a>; do homem na visão de Daniel <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:6\" href=\"/Daniel.10.6\">Dn 10.6</a> (corpo à parte das extremidades); também dos seres viventes na visão de Ezequiel <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.11\">Ez 1.11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.23\">Ez 1.23</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>corpo morto, cadáver, carcaça:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  de homem <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.10\">1Sm 31.10</a> (assim originalmente no paralelo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.10\">1Cr 10.10</a> veja-se We<sup>Sm</sup> cf. Dr) versículo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.12\">1Cr 10.12</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (singular de várias pessoas), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 110:6\" href=\"/Psalms.110.6\">Sl 110.6</a>; coletivo <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:3\" href=\"/Nahum.3.3\">Na 3.3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <strong>b.</strong>  de leão <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:8\" href=\"/Judges.14.8\">Jz 14.8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:9\" href=\"/Judges.14.9\">Jz 14.9</a>.",
