      "html": "† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּז</span>]</big>  <strong>verbo. passar, passar adiante (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">جَازَ</span> <em>passar por, passar além;</em> aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּז</span> <em>atravessar</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܳܙ</span> <em>passar, faltar</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּז</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:10\" href=\"/Psalms.90.10\">Sl 90.10</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫גָז</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:31\" href=\"/Numbers.11.31\">Nm 11.31</a>;—<em>passar</em>, da vida dos idosos, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:10\" href=\"/Psalms.90.10\">Sl 90.10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּז חִישׁ</span>; transitivo <em>trazer de além</em>, sujeito: vento, objeto: codornizes do mar, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:31\" href=\"/Numbers.11.31\">Nm 11.31</a> (leia-se talvez Hifil <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּגֶז</span> cf. Kö<sup>i 442</sup> Di).",
