      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּוַע</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo. expirar, perecer, morrer (</strong>cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">جَاعَ</span> <em>estar vazio, faminto</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּוַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:29\" href=\"/Numbers.20.29\">Nm 20.29</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:20\" href=\"/Joshua.22.20\">Js 22.20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּוָ֑עוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:19\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.19\">Lm 1.19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּוַעְנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:27\" href=\"/Numbers.17.27\">Nm 17.27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:3\" href=\"/Numbers.20.3\">Nm 20.3</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:15\" href=\"/Job.34.15\">Jó 34.15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוָ֑ע</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:17\" href=\"/Genesis.6.17\">Gn 6.17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוְעוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:12\" href=\"/Job.36.12\">Jó 36.12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוָ֑עוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 13:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.13.8\">Zc 13.8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוָע֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:29\" href=\"/Psalms.104.29\">Sl 104.29</a> etc.; infinitivo construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:3\" href=\"/Numbers.20.3\">Nm 20.3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוֹעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:28\" href=\"/Numbers.17.28\">Nm 17.28</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּוֵעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:16\" href=\"/Psalms.88.16\">Sl 88.16</a>;—<em>expirar</em> e morrer, somente P e poético; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ וימת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:8\" href=\"/Genesis.25.8\">Gn 25.8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:17\" href=\"/Genesis.25.17\">Gn 25.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:29\" href=\"/Genesis.35.29\">Gn 35.29</a> (todos P); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מות</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:11\" href=\"/Job.3.11\">Jó 3.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 14:10\" href=\"/Job.14.10\">Jó 14.10</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:28\" href=\"/Numbers.17.28\">Nm 17.28</a> (P); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אבד</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:27\" href=\"/Numbers.17.27\">Nm 17.27</a> <em>expiramos, perecemos</em> (P); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:16\" href=\"/Psalms.88.16\">Sl 88.16</a> (paralelismo progressivo) <em>aflito e prestes a morrer;</em> ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יאסף אל אבותיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:33\" href=\"/Genesis.49.33\">Gn 49.33</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">על־עפר ישׁוב</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:15\" href=\"/Job.34.15\">Jó 34.15</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:29\" href=\"/Psalms.104.29\">Sl 104.29</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יִכָּֽרְתוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 13:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.13.8\">Zc 13.8</a>; absoluto tanto em prosa como (especialmente) em poesia <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:3\" href=\"/Numbers.20.3\">Nm 20.3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:29\" href=\"/Numbers.20.29\">Nm 20.29</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:20\" href=\"/Joshua.22.20\">Js 22.20</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:17\" href=\"/Genesis.6.17\">Gn 6.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:21\" href=\"/Genesis.7.21\">Gn 7.21</a> (todos P) <a data-ref=\"Job 10:18\" href=\"/Job.10.18\">Jó 10.18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 13:19\" href=\"/Job.13.19\">Jó 13.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:5\" href=\"/Job.27.5\">Jó 27.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 36:12\" href=\"/Job.36.12\">Jó 36.12</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:19\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.19\">Lm 1.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 29:18\" href=\"/Job.29.18\">Jó 29.18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם־קִנִּי אגוע</span> <em>com meu ninho morrerei</em>, isto é, em plena posse do que é meu, cf. Di.",
