      "html": "† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מָגוֹר</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>lugar de residência temporária, morada, residência temporária</strong>—com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוּרָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:16\" href=\"/Psalms.55.16\">Sl 55.16</a>; plural construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוּרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:1\" href=\"/Genesis.37.1\">Gn 37.1</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוּרַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:9\" href=\"/Genesis.47.9\">Gn 47.9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוּרָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:54\" href=\"/Psalms.119.54\">Sl 119.54</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגֻרֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:8\" href=\"/Genesis.17.8\">Gn 17.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:4\" href=\"/Genesis.28.4\">Gn 28.4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוּרָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 18:19\" href=\"/Job.18.19\">Jó 18.19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוּרֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:7\" href=\"/Genesis.36.7\">Gn 36.7</a> + 2 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגֻרֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:4\" href=\"/Exodus.6.4\">Êx 6.4</a>;—<em>morada</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:16\" href=\"/Psalms.55.16\">Sl 55.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 18:19\" href=\"/Job.18.19\">Jó 18.19</a>;—<em>residência temporária</em> (lugar de <em>residência temporária</em>), sempre plural, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:8\" href=\"/Genesis.17.8\">Gn 17.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:4\" href=\"/Genesis.28.4\">Gn 28.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:7\" href=\"/Genesis.36.7\">Gn 36.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:1\" href=\"/Genesis.37.1\">Gn 37.1</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:4\" href=\"/Exodus.6.4\">Êx 6.4</a> (no Hexateuco sempre P) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:38\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.38\">Ez 20.38</a>; <em>residência temporária</em> (plural) = duração da vida, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנֵי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:9\" href=\"/Genesis.47.9\">Gn 47.9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יְמֵי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:9\" href=\"/Genesis.47.9\">Gn 47.9</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:54\" href=\"/Psalms.119.54\">Sl 119.54</a>.",
