      "html": "† II. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּר</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo. suscitar contenda, contender (</strong>cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גָּרָה\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּרָה\", dir=\"rtl\">גרה</a><strong>)</strong>—assim Ew Che Di RVm (<a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.15\">Is 54.15</a>); <strong>reunir-se</strong> Ges De Br cf. 𝔗 𝔙, assim AV RV;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.15\">Is 54.15</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יָגוּר</span> versículo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.15\">Is 54.15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יָגוּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 56:7\" href=\"/Psalms.56.7\">Sl 56.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:4\" href=\"/Psalms.59.4\">Sl 59.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:3\" href=\"/Psalms.140.3\">Sl 140.3</a> (sobre todos cf. abaixo); infinitivo absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.15\">Is 54.15</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>suscitar contenda</em>, absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹר יָגוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.15\">Is 54.15</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 56:7\" href=\"/Psalms.56.7\">Sl 56.7</a> (mas AE Che leem <span dir=\"rtl\">יָגוֹדּוּ</span> <em>atacar</em>, veja-se <a data-ref=\"BDB, גָּדַד\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּדַד\", dir=\"rtl\">גדד</a>); seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:4\" href=\"/Psalms.59.4\">Sl 59.4</a> (mas Che <em>idem</em>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:21\" href=\"/Psalms.94.21\">Sl 94.21</a>, que, entretanto, Ol emendaria com base em <a data-ref=\"Psalms 56:7\" href=\"/Psalms.56.7\">Sl 56.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:4\" href=\"/Psalms.59.4\">Sl 59.4</a>); seguido de acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלְחָמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:3\" href=\"/Psalms.140.3\">Sl 140.3</a> (Hup Che leem <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגָרוּ</span> imperfeito Piel de <span dir=\"rtl\">גרה</span>). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>contender</em>, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶת־</span> <em>com</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.15\">Is 54.15</a>. Aqui também <strong>Hitpoel.</strong> imperfeito <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:14\" href=\"/Hosea.7.14\">Os 7.14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְגּוֹרָ֖רוּ</span> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גּוּר\" href=\"/BDB,_גּוּר\", dir=\"rtl\">I. גור</a>), segundo Ew, <em>eles se excitam</em>, mas improvável; veja-se <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, גָּדַד\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּדַד\">גדד</a>.",
