      "html": "† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּר</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.3\">Ez 19:3</a></sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.5\">Ez 19.5</a> <strong>filhote, cria</strong>—construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּר(אַרְיֵה)</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:9\" href=\"/Genesis.49.9\">Gn 49.9</a> + 2 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּרֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.2\">Ez 19.2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּרֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.3\">Ez 19.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.5\">Ez 19.5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּרֵיהֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.3\">Lm 4.3</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>filhotes</em> de leão, figuradamente de Judá <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:9\" href=\"/Genesis.49.9\">Gn 49.9</a>; de Dã <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.22\">Dt 33.22</a>; do assírio (príncipe?) <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:12\" href=\"/Nahum.2.12\">Na 2.12</a>; figuradamente dos israelitas <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.2\">Ez 19.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.3\">Ez 19.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.5\">Ez 19.5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפִיר</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  crias de chacais <span dir=\"rtl\">(תַּנִּין)</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.3\">Lm 4.3</a>.",
