      "html": "† III. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּר</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo. temer (</strong>cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָגֹר\" href=\"/BDB,_יָגֹר\", dir=\"rtl\">יָגֹר</a><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּגָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:3\" href=\"/Numbers.22.3\">Nm 22.3</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.15\">1Sm 18.15</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּגוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.22\">Dt 18.22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָגוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.27\">Dt 32.27</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">יָגוּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:8\" href=\"/Psalms.33.8\">Sl 33.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 41:17\" href=\"/Job.41.17\">Jó 41.17</a> + <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:5\" href=\"/Hosea.10.5\">Os 10.5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּגוּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.17\">Dt 1.17</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:24\" href=\"/Psalms.22.24\">Sl 22.24</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:29\" href=\"/Job.19.29\">Jó 19.29</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>ter medo</em> de, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְּנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:3\" href=\"/Numbers.22.3\">Nm 22.3</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.17\">Dt 1.17</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.15\">1Sm 18.15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּרוּ לָכֶם מִפְּנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:29\" href=\"/Job.19.29\">Jó 19.29</a>; com <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:17\" href=\"/Job.41.17\">Jó 41.17</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.22\">Dt 18.22</a>; com acusativo <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.27\">Dt 32.27</a> (poético) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:5\" href=\"/Hosea.10.5\">Os 10.5</a> leia-se provavelmente <span dir=\"rtl\">ינודו</span> <em>lamentar</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אבל</span>, empregado com <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <em>por exemplo</em> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:7\" href=\"/Nahum.3.7\">Na 3.7</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.5\">Jr 15.5</a> e outros; cf. Che). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>ter temor reverente</em> de, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:24\" href=\"/Psalms.22.24\">Sl 22.24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:8\" href=\"/Psalms.33.8\">Sl 33.8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרֵא</span>).",
