      "preview": "גָּזַז: verbo: tosquiar; Qal e Nifal.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזַז</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo. tosquiar (</strong>hebraico novo <em>idem</em>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּזָז</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܰܙ</span>; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">جَزَّ</span>, assírio em derivado.<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫גָז</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 1:20\" href=\"/Job.1.20\">Jó 1.20</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּגֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.19\">Dt 15.19</a>; imperativo, 2.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזִּ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.29\">Jr 7.29</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּ֫זִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:16\" href=\"/Micah.1.16\">Mq 1.16</a>; infinitivo construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּזֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:19\" href=\"/Genesis.31.19\">Gn 31.19</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.2\">1Sm 25.2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּז</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:13\" href=\"/Genesis.38.13\">Gn 38.13</a> (J); particípio; <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּזֵז</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.4\">1Sm 25.4</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּזֲזִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.7\">1Sm 25.7</a> + 2 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּזֲזֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:12\" href=\"/Genesis.38.12\">Gn 38.12</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּזֲזָי֑</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.11\">1Sm 25.11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּזֲזֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.7\">Is 53.7</a>;—<em>tosquiar</em> ovelhas (objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאן</span>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:19\" href=\"/Genesis.31.19\">Gn 31.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:13\" href=\"/Genesis.38.13\">Gn 38.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.19\">Dt 15.19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.2\">1Sm 25.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.4\">1Sm 25.4</a>; cf. particípio <em>tosquiador</em> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">צאן</span>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:12\" href=\"/Genesis.38.12\">Gn 38.12</a>, também <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּזֲזֶיהָ</span> (isto é, <span dir=\"rtl\">רָחֵל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.7\">Is 53.7</a>; absoluto = <em>tosquiador de ovelhas</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.7\">1Sm 25.7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.11\">1Sm 25.11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.23\">2Sm 13.23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:24\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.24\">2Sm 13.24</a>; objeto: cabeça de homem <span dir=\"rtl\">(ראשׁוֹ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 1:20\" href=\"/Job.1.20\">Jó 1.20</a>; de mulher (figura de Israel) <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:16\" href=\"/Micah.1.16\">Mq 1.16</a> (sem objeto; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קרחי</span>), (figura de Jerusalém) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.29\">Jr 7.29</a> (objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵזֶר</span>, veja-se)<br><strong>Nifal.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">נָגוֹ֫זּוּ</span> <em>ser cortado</em> (= destruído), dos assírios <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:12\" href=\"/Nahum.1.12\">Na 1.12</a>.",
