      "html": "† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזַל</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo. arrancar, apoderar-se, roubar (</strong>hebraico novo <em>idem</em>, fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">גזל</span> Nifal, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּזַל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܠܰܙ</span> e (Nas.) <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܙܰܠ</span>; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">جَزَلَ</span> <em>cortar fora</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:19\" href=\"/Job.20.19\">Jó 20.19</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.18\">Ez 18.18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזָ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.23\">Lv 5.23</a> + 2 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזַלְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:5\" href=\"/Psalms.69.5\">Sl 69.5</a> etc.; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְזֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.7\">Ez 18.7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּגְזֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.21\">2Sm 23.21</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.23\">1Cr 11.23</a> etc.; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּזֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.2\">Is 10.2</a>; particípio ativo <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹזֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.24\">Pv 28.24</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּזְלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:10\" href=\"/Psalms.35.10\">Sl 35.10</a>; plural construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּזְלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:2\" href=\"/Micah.3.2\">Mq 3.2</a>; passivo <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזוּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.29\">Dt 28.29</a> + 4 vezes;—<em>arrancar, roubar</em>, com objeto de coisa (móvel), rebanho <span dir=\"rtl\">(עֵדֶר)</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:2\" href=\"/Job.24.2\">Jó 24.2</a>, jumento <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:31\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.31\">Dt 28.31</a>, mulheres <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:23\" href=\"/Judges.21.23\">Jz 21.23</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:31\" href=\"/Genesis.31.31\">Gn 31.31</a> (E), arrancar criança órfã do peito <a data-ref=\"Job 24:9\" href=\"/Job.24.9\">Jó 24.9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יתום מִשֹּׁד</span>, arrebatar uma lança da mão do inimigo <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.21\">2Sm 23.21</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.23\">1Cr 11.23</a>; figuradamente do secamento das águas da neve <a data-ref=\"Job 24:19\" href=\"/Job.24.19\">Jó 24.19</a>; (objeto imóvel) <em>tomar posse violentamente de</em>, poço de água <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:25\" href=\"/Genesis.21.25\">Gn 21.25</a> (E), casa <a data-ref=\"Job 20:19\" href=\"/Job.20.19\">Jó 20.19</a>, campos <a data-ref=\"Micah 2:2\" href=\"/Micah.2.2\">Mq 2.2</a>; (hiperbolicamente) a pele <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:2\" href=\"/Micah.3.2\">Mq 3.2</a>; com acusativo cognato = <em>apoderar-se, saquear</em>, objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּזֵלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.23\">Lv 5.23</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.7\">Ez 18.7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.12\">Ez 18.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.16\">Ez 18.16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.18\">Ez 18.18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.29\">Ez 22.29</a>; indefinido <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:5\" href=\"/Psalms.69.5\">Sl 69.5</a>; figuradamente, objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁפָּט</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.2\">Is 10.2</a>; com objeto da pessoa roubada <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:10\" href=\"/Psalms.35.10\">Sl 35.10</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.22\">Pv 22.22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.24\">Pv 28.24</a>, provavelmente também <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:25\" href=\"/Judges.9.25\">Jz 9.25</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.13\">Lv 19.13</a> (H; absoluto); cf. também passivo <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.29\">Dt 28.29</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשׁוּק</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">הציל גָּזוּל מיד עושׁק</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 21:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.21.12\">Jr 21.12</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.3\">Jr 22.3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:13\" href=\"/Malachi.1.13\">Ml 1.13</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזוּל</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּסֵּחַ</span> <em>coxo</em> e <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹלֶה</span> <em>doente</em>), provavelmente aquilo que foi resgatado após ser arrebatado por feras, portanto mutilado.<br>†<strong>Nifal.</strong>  perfeito, 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנִגְזְלָה</span>, sujeito <em>sono</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.16\">Pv 4.16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לא</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְֽׁנוּ</span>).",
